msgstr "Une pastille flottante pour chaque partie de la barre supérieure, des coins doux partout"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Floating"
msgstr "Flottant"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "One rounded top bar held off the edge of the screen"
msgstr "Une barre supérieure arrondie, décollée du bord de l’écran"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Hairline"
msgstr "Filet"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "A thin, solid top bar, crisp corners and fine lines"
msgstr "Une barre supérieure fine et pleine, des coins nets et des lignes fines"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Capsule"
msgstr "Capsule"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "The clock in a dark capsule, and everything else a pill"
msgstr "L’horloge dans une capsule sombre, et tout le reste en pastille"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Monospace, square and lined, like a terminal"
msgstr "À chasse fixe, carré et tracé au trait, comme un terminal"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Segments"
msgstr "Segments"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "The top bar in blocks of the theme's colours"
msgstr "La barre supérieure en blocs aux couleurs du thème"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Dark glass outlined and glowing in the theme's accent"
msgstr "Du verre sombre, souligné et brillant de l’accent du thème"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Style"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The shape of the top bar, menus, notifications, dialogs, buttons and windows."
msgstr "La forme de la barre supérieure, des menus, des notifications, des boîtes de dialogue, des boutons et des fenêtres."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Amethystora UI is not installed."
msgstr "Amethystora UI n’est pas installé."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while Reduce transparency is on."
msgstr "Le verre est dessiné plein tant que Réduire la transparence est activé."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while High Contrast is on."
msgstr "Le verre est dessiné plein tant que Contraste élevé est activé."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while the power saver is on."
msgstr "Le verre est dessiné plein tant que l’économie d’énergie est active."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Frost"
msgstr "Givre"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Thick, milky glass with an even tint"
msgstr "Un verre épais et laiteux, à la teinte uniforme"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Prism"
msgstr "Prisme"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Less tint, more colour, a lit top edge and light along the bottom"
msgstr "Moins de teinte, plus de couleur, un bord supérieur éclairé et de la lumière le long du bas"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/amethystora-ui@arsslensoft.github.io/modules/pill/digest.js
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Limpide"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "The thinnest glass and the brightest rim; it darkens by itself where text needs it"
msgstr "Le verre le plus fin et le bord le plus brillant ; il s’assombrit de lui-même là où le texte en a besoin"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "What the top bar, the dock, menus and notifications show of the wallpaper behind them."
msgstr "Ce que la barre supérieure, le dock, les menus et les notifications montrent du fond d’écran derrière eux."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Comfort"
msgstr "Confort"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The power saver makes the glass solid for as long as it is on."
msgstr "L’économie d’énergie rend le verre plein aussi longtemps qu’elle est active."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Reduce transparency"
msgstr "Réduire la transparence"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass becomes the theme's solid surfaces. Nothing is blurred, which also saves power."
msgstr "Le verre devient les surfaces pleines du thème. Rien n’est flouté, ce qui économise aussi de l’énergie."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Animations are off in Settings, under Accessibility, which is calmer still."
msgstr "Les animations sont désactivées dans Paramètres, sous Accessibilité, ce qui est plus calme encore."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Reduce motion"
msgstr "Réduire les mouvements"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Animations fade in place instead of travelling."
msgstr "Les animations se fondent sur place au lieu de se déplacer."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Increase contrast"
msgstr "Augmenter le contraste"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "GNOME's High Contrast: stronger outlines, plain text and outlined controls, in the apps as well."
msgstr "Le Contraste élevé de GNOME : des contours plus marqués, du texte simple et des commandes détourées, dans les applications aussi."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The speech recognizer is not in this image."
msgstr "La reconnaissance vocale n’est pas dans cette image."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/libexec/amethystora-sends usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/amethystora-ui@arsslensoft.github.io/modules/captions.js
