msgstr "Pendant cinq minutes"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "One password, then five minutes for that agent alone"
msgstr "Un mot de passe, puis cinq minutes pour cet agent seul"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
